{"name": "Project Chameleon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape-shift into objects to go unnoticed by your enemies while carrying out stealth missions around the world. Manipulate environmental objects, set traps, and use gadgets like a true spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"126\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/7bc6a08bb6c581667cf7945c338745d6.avif?t=1774628806\" width=\"573\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/edf31bdcaf4ab35c044afa1e1975ae64.poster.avif?t=1774628806\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/edf31bdcaf4ab35c044afa1e1975ae64.webm?t=1774628806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/edf31bdcaf4ab35c044afa1e1975ae64.mp4?t=1774628806\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your powerful suit to transform into different objects. Carefully choose the objects you transform into because the suit needs to recharge after use!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"126\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/2ef7b138a4aedec3807ea2cf2450d445.avif?t=1774628806\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/272835ad12a1beac813f66af9224153c.poster.avif?t=1774628806\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/272835ad12a1beac813f66af9224153c.webm?t=1774628806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/272835ad12a1beac813f66af9224153c.mp4?t=1774628806\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some objects have unique utilities that can be used to manipulate the environment. Use a sophisticated hacking system, lure guards with sound-emitting objects, and more. Use these additional abilities to tackle more complex challenges! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"126\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fdf871551a31da596ad4b59cceeb67d1.avif?t=1774628806\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fcf5f57a7e9d83d59b1ed861377c2319.poster.avif?t=1774628806\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fcf5f57a7e9d83d59b1ed861377c2319.webm?t=1774628806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fcf5f57a7e9d83d59b1ed861377c2319.mp4?t=1774628806\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find advanced gadgets and various items in each scenario. Use them to help Siren in her missions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"126\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/2fdb312556e7ccb742bd8f8a988f6f87.avif?t=1774628806\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/6bce024d6858e917f25c3ebcc3b7504c.poster.avif?t=1774628806\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/6bce024d6858e917f25c3ebcc3b7504c.webm?t=1774628806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/6bce024d6858e917f25c3ebcc3b7504c.mp4?t=1774628806\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform into various objects and blend into the environment to remain unseen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate the environment with diverse abilities from special objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use advanced gadgets and various items in each chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face eccentric and challenging missions while traveling through various countries around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 80 levels divided into chapters, with unique settings, enemies, and mechanics.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Shape-shift into objects to go unnoticed by your enemies while carrying out stealth missions around the world. Manipulate environmental objects, set traps, and use gadgets like a true spy.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/header.jpg?t=1774628806", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Stealth", "Puzzle", "2D", "Pixel Graphics", "Espionage", "Female Protagonist"], "developers": "Anonymous King", "publishers": "Anonymous King", "release_date": "Mar 27, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3163560", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "20 January 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/jGs0Y-d0rjw", "first_seen": 1737331